cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SocialGraph-FM in research, please cite this software."
title: "SocialGraph-FM: A Graph Foundation Model Workbench for Social Governance Research"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SocialGraph-FM contributors"
abstract: >-
  A CPU-only research workbench for Windows x64 and Ubuntu x64, supporting
  deterministic social-graph analysis, evidence-oriented human review, and
  governed Graph Foundation Model workflows.
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - graph foundation model
  - social network analysis
  - social governance
  - human review
  - graph machine learning
